menu "Configuration manager"

    config CONFIG_MANAGER_PUBSUB
        bool "Serve the configuration on the pubsub-c bus"
        default y
        help
            Build ConfigManager (config_mgr.hpp): a task that answers the config.* topics, plus RegisterConfig()
            and GetSettings(). Without it only ConfigStore (config_store.hpp) is built, used by direct calls.

endmenu
